<title>UK: Berlin Hannoverische Hypo sets 250 mln mark bond.</title>
<headline>Berlin Hannoverische Hypo sets 250 mln mark bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Dresdner Kleinwort Benson.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BERLIN HANNOVERISCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    250 MLN DEM   COUPON   **3.875     MATURITY    17.NOV.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.65    PAY DATE   S17.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.75	LISTING    BER/HAN   PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (K) 1	   SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.10	SELL CONC  1.65	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES    **UNTIL 17.NOV.97, THEN STEPS UP TO 4.2 PCT IF NOT</p>
<p>		CALLED AT PAR</p>
<p>		S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>		OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF SERIES 78</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
